*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0018
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-06-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 732
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0018.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY PEN0018C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 ACCOUNT-STAT       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
        88 ACCOUNT-SUSPENDED VALUE 'S'.
    *> LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 4000-REPEAT-LATE
    PERFORM REFER-COLLECTIONS
    DISPLAY "ACCOUNT-STAT=" ACCOUNT-STAT
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
4000-REPEAT-LATE.
    *> REPEAT LATE PAYER SUSPENSION
    IF LATE-PMTS-YR >= 4 AND DAYS-PAST-DUE > 45
        SET ACCOUNT-SUSPENDED TO TRUE
        ADD 100 TO LATE-CHARGE
    END-IF.
REFER-COLLECTIONS.
    *> COLLECTIONS REFERRAL
    IF DAYS-PAST-DUE > 90
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCOUNT-STAT
    END-IF.
